Default geometry removal: middle priority, crossings :branch_c0 b bReverse; :middle_c0 a aReverse
Ignore crossings alone: middle priority, crossings :branch_c0 b bReverse; :middle_c0 a aReverse
Plain input with both options: joined at middle, crossings :branch_c0 a bReverse
SUMO input with both options: joined at middle, crossings :branch_c0 a bReverse
Protected edge: middle priority, crossings :branch_c0 b bReverse; :middle_c0 a aReverse
Signal-controlled crossing: middle traffic_light, crossings :branch_c0 b bReverse; :middle_c0 a aReverse
